              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "régner — \"to reign, to rule\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ce roi a régné pendant quarante ans. This king reigned for forty years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Figurative: le silence régnait — silence reigned."
            }
          ]
